&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location Details:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;United Kingdom - Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW139143358 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW139143358 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;fontsizemedium&quot; data-ccp-charstyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;8d68e83b-6167-45eb-be35-44bf50f96f7f|148&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[469775450,&amp;quot;fontsizemedium&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;fontsizemedium&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Default Paragraph Font&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;At GoDaddy the future of work looks different for each team. Some teams work in the office full-time; others have a hybrid arrangement (they work remotely some days and in the office some days) and some work entirely remotely.​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a remote position, so you’ll be working remotely from your home. You may occasionally visit a GoDaddy office to meet with your team for events or meetings. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our team...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Be part of the fast-growing team at GoDaddy Corporate Domains, the corporate registrar within the GoDaddy family. We are looking to hire an experienced, hardworking and results-driven Account Executive to join our team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What you&#39;ll get to do…&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;As an Account Executive at GoDaddy Corporate Domains, you&#39;ll play a key role in expanding GCD&#39;s presence across the UK and Europe, building relationships and securing new business with some of the regions best-known companies. This is a consultative sales role where you’ll work with stakeholders across Legal, Marketing and IT to deliver value through our domain portfolio management solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a high-performing, self-motivated Account Executive who is comfortable navigating complex organisations, takes initiative and is confident engaging with prospective customers over the phone, in virtual&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;meetings and in person. You’ll guide&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;enterprise customers from the initial conversation through to a signed agreement, taking responsibility for developing new business relationships, managing the full sales cycle and finding creative ways to demonstrate how our solutions address their needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You should have strong communication skills, a strategic mindset and a passion for helping global brands protect and optimise their digital presence. Internally and externally, your focus will be on earning trust, exceeding expectations and making GoDaddy Corporate Domains the most respected name in enterprise domain management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*This role requires approximately 20% travel, primarily for in-person client meetings and industry events.&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your experience should include…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8 + years experience in a business development or sales role, preferably within a software-as-a-service (SaaS) company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing new business with enterprise customers across the UK and European markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of proactively sourcing opportunities and building a pipeline through targeted prospecting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of meeting or exceeding sales targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, with experience presenting to and engaging with senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organisational skills, with the ability to meet deadlines and work well under pressure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high degree of accuracy and close attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling to a range of stakeholder groups, from Legal and Brand Protection to IT and Marketing, and tailoring your approach to each audience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An energetic, proactive approach and the ability to work well in a fast-paced, entrepreneurial environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in Microsoft Word, Excel and PowerPoint&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to generate and qualify leads by phone, email and in person&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A commitment to developing subject matter expertise in corporate domain name management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You might also have…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subject matter expertise in corporate domain name management and/or brand protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building strong relationships with prospective customers through problem-solving and sharing expertise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and managing a sales pipeline in HubSpot&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strategic approach to identifying more effective ways to develop new business and collaborate with the wider sales team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building lasting customer relationships that support retention and long-term customer value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to identify and develop client referrals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience maintaining accurate records of meetings, sales activity and opportunity progress&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We encourage you to apply even if your experience or skillset doesn’t align perfectly with every requirement. We value a wide range of backgrounds and transferable skills, and we are excited to support learning and growth.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;ve&amp;nbsp;got your back...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;  &lt;/strong&gt;We offer a range of total rewards that may include paid time off, retirement savings (e.g., 401k, pension schemes), bonus/incentive eligibility, equity grants, participation in our employee stock purchase plan, competitive health benefits, and other family-friendly benefits including parental leave. GoDaddy’s benefits vary based on individual role and location and can be reviewed in more detail during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us...&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;GoDaddy is empowering everyday entrepreneurs around the world by providing the help and tools to succeed online, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;making opportunity more inclusive for all.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; GoDaddy is the place people come to name their idea, build a professional website, attract customers, sell their products and services, and manage their work. Our mission is to give our customers the tools, insights, and people to transform their ideas and personal initiative into success. To learn more about the company, visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Faboutus.godaddy.net%2Fabout-us%2Foverview%2Fdefault.aspx&amp;amp;data=05%7C01%7Cklilas%40godaddy.com%7C4a7c273441f14a72548908dab30d54f3%7Cd5f1622b14a345a6b069003f8dc4851f%7C0%7C0%7C638019167147789183%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=JKqNxY8z5E%2BjfKXCtVVYGLmGXuv31qCpLmWP960VLzo%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At GoDaddy, we know diverse teams build better products—period. Our people and culture reflect and celebrate that sense of diversity and inclusion in ideas, experiences and perspectives. But we also know that’s not enough to build true equity and belonging in our communities. That’s why we prioritize integrating diversity, equity, inclusion and belonging principles into the core of how we work every day—focusing not only on our employee experience, but also our customer experience and operations. It’s the best way to serve our mission of empowering entrepreneurs everywhere, and making opportunity more inclusive for all. To read more about these commitments, as well as our representation and pay equity data, check out our Diversity and Pay Parity annual report which can be&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;found on our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.godaddy/diversity&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Diversity Careers page&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We also embrace our diverse culture and offer a range of Employee Resource Groups (&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.godaddy/culture&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Culture&lt;/a&gt;). Have a side hustle? No problem. We love entrepreneurs! Most importantly, come as you are and make your own way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;GoDaddy is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. GoDaddy will consider for employment qualified applicants with criminal histories in a manner consistent with local and federal requirements.&lt;/em&gt; &lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Refer to our full&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt; &lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.godaddy.com/legal/agreements/equal-opportunity-employment-statement&quot;&gt;EEO policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our recruiting team is available to assist you in completing your application. If they could be helpful, please reach out to -----
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GoDaddy doesn’t accept unsolicited resumes from recruiters or employment agencies.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curious Minds. Bold Ideas. Extraordinary Impact&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re transforming financial services through bold innovation and relentless execution. You bring the ideas and drive. We&#39;ll build what&#39;s next — together.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As nCino&#39;s Enterprise Account Executive for Corporate Solutions, you&#39;ll be responsible for net-new sales to prospects and for driving expansion within our existing customer base.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be selling beyond traditional banking and lending, into gaming, fintech and payments, and into the wider B2B market across a defined set of industries. You&#39;ll have a clear target account list, a structured sales process, and strong pre-sales and customer success support behind you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role matters because it takes nCino&#39;s mission to new markets, and you&#39;ll have real room to grow as we build our presence in them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll sell into two connected markets:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regulated businesses that have to verify individuals. &lt;/strong&gt;Gaming and gambling, fintech, payments and similar businesses are required by regulation to know who their customers are. The challenge is doing those KYC and anti money laundering checks quickly and reliably, without losing customers at sign up and without exposing the business to fraud or regulatory risk. You&#39;ll help these businesses get that right.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;B2B businesses that need to find, check and onboard other businesses. &lt;/strong&gt;Outside financial services, many companies still win and onboard business customers with too little information. They struggle to find the right companies to target, to know who really owns and controls them, and to check them before a contract is signed. You&#39;ll help sales and compliance teams find better prospects and onboard business customers with confidence, with fewer manual checks and less risk of fraud or bad debt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our priority industries on the B2B side are accountancy, tax and corporate services, telecoms and connectivity, legal services, and construction, infrastructure and supply chains. Wider opportunities sit in energy and utilities, commercial property, wholesale and distribution, and staffing and recruitment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You don&#39;t need to know these sectors before you start. You do need to learn them quickly and talk about their problems credibly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and target prospective customers within a defined set of target accounts, industries and market segments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenge prospects to consider a new and innovative approach to verifying customers and onboarding businesses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive opportunities through qualification and closure while maintaining a pipeline sufficient to achieve and exceed quarterly and annual sales goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a strong nCino brand presence in your target industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use a consultative approach to understand each client&#39;s regulatory and commercial problem, and match our solutions to it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage complex sales cycles by mapping out decision-making and approval processes, compressing timelines, negotiating contracts and closing business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify prospect &quot;mobilisers&quot; and build consensus among key stakeholders across compliance, risk, technology and commercial teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with pre-sales, marketing and business development to run outbound campaigns and keep a consistent message in the marketplace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use a structured sales methodology (MEDDPICC) to qualify well and forecast accurately&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expand nCino&#39;s presence within existing clients by maintaining relationships with key stakeholders and partnering with our Customer Success team to drive adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sell newly released nCino products and offerings to existing customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Ideally You&#39;ll Have:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Substantial experience of complex enterprise sales, or a combination of experience, education and superior performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong professional background with a consistent record of excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven record of winning new business in B2B software, data or a similar complex enterprise sale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to challenge executive decision makers, build consensus with client executives and sell to the C-suite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong listening skills and impeccable verbal and written communication; able to demonstrate solutions on site with the client or in virtual meetings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;History of success in a collaborative work environment; demonstrable ability to partner with product, pre-sales, professional services, support, finance and others to achieve sales goals and customer success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel to client locations within the UK as required to accomplish and exceed goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Desired&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling into regulated markets, or selling compliance, risk or identity solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in one or more of our target industries, such as gaming, fintech, payments, professional services, telecoms or construction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling data or API based solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on use of MEDDPICC or a similar methodology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Graduate degree and/or other certifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible problem-solver who will thrive in nCino&#39;s collaborative, entrepreneurial environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organised, efficient, and able to maintain a high level of production while also demonstrating process and administrative excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;In Return We&#39;re Offering:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll join a business that values different perspectives and backgrounds, and we want everyone to feel they belong here. We welcome applications from all backgrounds and make reasonable adjustments throughout our hiring process. Alongside a clear path to grow your career with us, you&#39;ll receive:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company pension — 6% employer contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days’ paid holiday plus volunteer days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life insurance and group income protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cycle to work and gym membership salary sacrifice schemes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perkbox — discounts, free coffee, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Stock Purchase Plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Our Culture:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We Live the Six, our values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have Fun: we keep it positive, whether that&#39;s celebrating wins or watching sports together&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make Someone&#39;s Day: we put customer success and positive interactions first&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring Your A-Game: we deliver excellence and high performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Do the Right Thing: we operate with integrity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respect Each Other: we foster a supportive and inclusive culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a Winner: we strive for success as a team and as individuals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ready to make an impact? Apply now.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/QvuQK4rqTQ0&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The pay range for this role is based on relative market data and alignment with our compensation philosophy. The range displayed reflects the minimum and maximum of the pay range for each job posting, which is used to determine new hire rates/salaries and takes into consideration multiple factors including but not limited to knowledge, skills, abilities, proficiencies, experience, education, &lt;span class=&quot;WGI1&quot;&gt;licensures/certifications,&lt;/span&gt; as well as business and organizational needs. nCino reserves the right to modify the posted range consistent with our internal practices and external market movement. The recruiter for this job posting can share more compensation details during the recruitment process, as base salary is only one component of the total compensation package per position posted.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The base salary range for this job is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£69,300&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£128,200 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;nCino provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, protected veteran status, disability, genetics or other protected groups. In addition to federal law requirements, nCino complies with applicable state and local laws governing nondiscrimination in employment in every location in which the company has facilities. This policy applies to all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, placement, promotion, termination, layoff, recall, transfer, leaves of absence, compensation and training.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;nCino is committed to the full inclusion of all qualified individuals. As part of this commitment, nCino will ensure that persons with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodations. If reasonable accommodation is needed to participate in the job application or interview process, to perform essential job functions, and/or to receive other benefits and privileges of employment, please contact us at &lt;a ----- -----
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to inclusion and equality includes a strong belief that the diversity of our team is instrumental to our success.&amp;nbsp; We strive to create workplaces where employees are empowered to bring their authentic selves to work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.ncino.com/ncino-applicant-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;Please view our Applicant Privacy Policy here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Flexport:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Flexport, we believe global trade can move the human race forward. That’s why it’s our mission to make global commerce so easy there will be more of it. We’re shaping the future of a $10T industry with solutions powered by innovative technology and exceptional people. Today, companies of all sizes—from emerging brands to Fortune 500s—use Flexport technology to move more than $19B of merchandise across 112 countries a year.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The recent global supply chain crisis has put Flexport center stage as we continue to play a pivotal role in how goods move around the world. We are proud to have the support of the best investors in the game who believe in our mission, solutions and people. Ready to tackle global challenges that impact business, society, and the environment? Come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Applied AI Engineer, Autonomous Supply Chains&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About Flexport&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Look around you. Almost everything in the room crossed an ocean to get there. Moving one container from a factory to a warehouse takes 10 to 15 companies: truckers, customs brokers, port terminals, ocean carriers, insurers, lenders and warehouses, each with its own systems, paperwork and rules. A freight forwarder runs that whole journey, so the brand that makes the goods doesn&#39;t have to.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Most forwarders still run it on email, spreadsheets and phone calls. We call it email freight forwarding. Flexport runs it on one platform, where AI agents do the routine work and experts step in where judgment matters. We&#39;ve moved $175B of goods for more than 13,000 brands across 135 countries. Our agents handle 21 million tasks a year, and up to 80% of customs work is automated.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Global logistics is a $13 trillion industry, and even the largest forwarder earns less than 3% of global logistics outsourcing revenue. People-powered operations don&#39;t scale: to grow, you hire. Software broke that ceiling for taxis with Uber, and for payments with Adyen and Stripe. Freight is next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Amsterdam is one of Flexport&#39;s six engineering hubs, alongside San Francisco, Seattle, Chicago, Shanghai and Shenzhen. We own four domains end to end: Customs Technology, Autonomous Supply Chains (Applied AI), Platform and Security. See what we build at &lt;a href=&quot;https://amsterdam-engineering.flexport.com&quot;&gt;amsterdam-engineering.flexport.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The team: Autonomous Supply Chains&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Logistics is famously hard to automate, because the happy path rarely happens. One customer won&#39;t take deliveries on a Tuesday. Another wants invoices only on Fridays, with some lines merged and others renamed. Until recently, people handled all of that by hand. Now operators use Forge, the agentic platform we build, to automate their own work: catching anomalies, routing exceptions, escalating stuck containers and adjusting invoices to each customer. Forge remembers every customer&#39;s rules and learns from every workflow run, so it gets smarter every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Autonomous Supply Chains is our Applied AI team: small, senior and reporting to the VP of Engineering. Self-driving cars are rated from level 0 to level 5. Most of the freight industry still runs at level 0: people emailing spreadsheets. Our goal is level 5 for freight, with Forge as the best agentic platform there is, handling every complexity, every calamity and every odd preference without skipping a beat.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stack:&lt;/strong&gt; TypeScript, Rust, Next.js, Temporal, Postgres and Snowflake, with models from Anthropic, OpenAI and Google.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Applied AI Engineer II on Autonomous Supply Chains, you&#39;ll build the agents and AI-powered applications that make Flexport&#39;s operations faster and increasingly autonomous. You&#39;ll find the most painful problems in our operations, design the solution and ship it to operators moving freight across 135 countries. This isn&#39;t a role where you join a team and pick up tickets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and ship end-to-end AI agents that handle real logistics work, such as customs compliance, document processing, invoice validation and exception management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the evaluation, guardrails and human-in-the-loop flows that make an agent trustworthy enough to run 24/7.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay on top of what&#39;s happening in the world of AI, and channel those innovations straight into the product. When Jev came out this fall, we had three use cases live within two weeks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with operators, domain experts and leadership to turn ambiguous problems into shipped products, and measure whether they worked.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Move fast from idea to production, and treat every deployment as a chance to learn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross organizational boundaries to understand problems deeply and get things done without waiting for permission.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You should have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of software engineering experience, and you&#39;ve built seriously with LLMs, whether in production, in side projects or just because you couldn&#39;t stop yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;LLM fluency: agent patterns, tool use, RAG, prompt design and evaluation. You know the difference between what works in production and what looks good in a demo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full-stack capability in TypeScript and Next.js. You can own a feature end to end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product instinct: you can tell what&#39;s worth building, not just how to build it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear written and spoken communication in English, including design docs that people actually read.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice to have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with workflow orchestration, such as Temporal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building internal tools or operator-facing applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;How we work&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We value builders.&lt;/strong&gt; People who think end to end, do their own discovery and ship independently. Nobody hands you a spec.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your users sit next to you.&lt;/strong&gt; Operators, customs experts and account teams work in the same office. Watch them use your tool, and fix it before dessert.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Any model, any harness.&lt;/strong&gt; Use any frontier model from Anthropic, OpenAI or Google, in all the popular coding harnesses. Our engineers manage swarms of coding agents from their first week.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We ship dozens of times a day,&lt;/strong&gt; with continuous deployment and a platform team obsessed with making it safe and fast.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid, in English.&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;re together in our office on Nieuwezijds Voorburgwal, a few minutes from Dam Square, three days a week*. The other days are flexible. English is our working language, and we work daily with colleagues in the US and China.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No logistics background needed.&lt;/strong&gt; Almost nobody joins knowing what an HTS code or a bill of lading is. The experts sit a few desks away.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile, but not dogmatic.&lt;/strong&gt; Teams decide how they work best.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why this role is special&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your work is visible:&lt;/strong&gt; a small, senior team that reports to the VP of Engineering. What you build gets noticed, and your ideas shape the direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real stakes:&lt;/strong&gt; your agents act on real shipments for 13,000+ brands in 135 countries, so the impact is immediate and measurable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re early:&lt;/strong&gt; the playbook for applied AI in logistics hasn&#39;t been written yet. You&#39;ll help write it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s in it for you&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equity for everyone:&lt;/strong&gt; every team member becomes a shareholder in a pre-IPO company in a multi-trillion dollar industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;25 vacation days,&lt;/strong&gt; based on full-time employment, plus Dutch public holidays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health insurance, fully paid:&lt;/strong&gt; a collective plan with basic and additional packages. Flexport pays the monthly premium.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pension:&lt;/strong&gt; a defined contribution scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Breakfast and lunch:&lt;/strong&gt; daily catered lunch with vegetarian options, breakfast, snacks and drinks in the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commute covered:&lt;/strong&gt; Flexport covers home-to-office commuting costs if you live outside Amsterdam.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Parental leave:&lt;/strong&gt; time off for both parents to bond with a new child.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellbeing support:&lt;/strong&gt; an Employee Assistance Program through Aetna for you and your household, at no cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Visa sponsorship:&lt;/strong&gt; we sponsor visas for the right candidates and help you move to Amsterdam. Eligible international hires may also benefit from the Dutch expat tax ruling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our hiring process&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application review:&lt;/strong&gt; our team reviews your application.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruiter screen:&lt;/strong&gt; talk about your experience, the role and your questions about Flexport.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote coding:&lt;/strong&gt; your first coding interview takes place over video.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Onsite coding and system design:&lt;/strong&gt; a second coding interview and system design in our office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project deep dive:&lt;/strong&gt; discuss a project from your experience with the hiring manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team debrief:&lt;/strong&gt; the interview team reviews feedback together. You don&#39;t attend this step.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Offer:&lt;/strong&gt; if there&#39;s a match, your recruiter walks you through the offer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An additional remote coding round may be needed if the earlier coding interviews leave questions to resolve. Your recruiter will confirm the plan before interviews begin. We only contact candidates from ----- addresses, and we will never ask you for money or banking details.&lt;/p&gt;
